WEBVTT

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.900 line:0%
[Episode 35]

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:50.920 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.839 line:0%
come here and take a look.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:53.720 line:0%
This is fine silk

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.180 line:0%
delivered from Jiangnan.

00:01:55.839 --> 00:01:57.570 line:0%
Look at the pattern and fabric.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:58.640 line:0%
I'll have an embroiderer

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.100 line:0%
make a wedding dress for you. How about that?

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:11.360 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:14.760 line:0%
Look.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.600 line:0%
I'll wear this for the occasion.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.240 line:0%
What do you think?

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.320 line:0%
Are you crazy?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.360 line:0%
I won't marry you.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.450 line:0%
Of course you will marry me.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.400 line:0%
One day,

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.450 line:0%
you will be willing to marry me.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:44.960 line:0%
Look.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.760 line:0%
These two pieces of clothing

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.570 line:0%
look so perfect together.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.320 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.200 line:0%
You bastard! Let me go!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.350 line:0%
Before you like me the way

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.740 line:0%
you like Jiang Langxing

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.410 line:0%
and before you're willing to marry me,

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.320 line:0%
I won't let you go.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.640 line:0%
I will never like you!

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.780 line:0%
You will.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:24.879 line:0%
What?

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.320 line:0%
Are you still hoping

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.980 line:0%
someone will come to save you?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.600 line:0%
It won't happen.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.760 line:0%
Neither Jiang Langxing nor Yan Xing

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.040 line:0%
will come to save you.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.600 line:0%
I'm warning you,

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.120 line:0%
don't you dare hurt them!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.560 line:0%
I won't hurt them,

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.560 line:0%
unless they have a death wish.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:49.760 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:53.960 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.600 line:0%
In this world,

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.800 line:0%
everyone only cares about themselves.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.160 line:0%
No one can be relied upon.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.430 line:0%
You only have me.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:12.760 line:0%
Only me.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.320 line:0%
What?

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.900 line:0%
You're not slapping me this time?

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.080 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.040 line:0%
I truly adore you.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.000 line:0%
From now on,

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.080 line:0%
I won't force you anymore.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.800 line:0%
I will wait patiently,

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:44.730 line:0%
until

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.030 line:0%
the day you truly fall in love with me.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:14.640 line:0%
Ms. Jin.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.360 line:0%
Excuse me.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:17.460 line:0%
Coming through.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.440 line:0%
-Yan Xing!
-Slow down.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:22.200 line:0%
Xing!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:24.640 line:0%
Mother.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.360 line:0%
Mother.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.020 line:0%
You've been released?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.730 line:0%
Your father has a conscience.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:31.800 line:0%
He wrote a petition,

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.920 line:0%
saying I'm a married daughter

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:35.250 line:0%
and I'm already a member of the Yan family.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.550 line:0%
It was Minister Zhang.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.680 line:0%
He sent word to permit me to write it.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:40.680 line:0%
Grand Commander

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.880 line:0%
sent people from the Imperial Security Bureau

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.080 line:0%
to escort her with me.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:43.880 line:0%
Madam,

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.810 line:0%
Grand Commander has already entered the palace.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.080 line:0%
Mother,

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.120 line:0%
you've suffered.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.160 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.720 line:0%
It's just your uncle.

00:05:52.959 --> 00:05:53.959 line:0%
Your uncle, he...

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.720 line:0%
Your Majesty, please be clear!

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.660 line:0%
"Joy and Sorrow" was composed by me!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.440 line:0%
It has nothing to do with Prince Xian!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.590 line:0%
It has even less to do with my clansmen!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.500 line:0%
Prince Xian and I

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:10.520 line:0%
understand and appreciate each other, like Bo Ya and Ziqi.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.560 line:0%
All of this

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.160 line:0%
is Lai Luozhi's conspiracy!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.570 line:0%
Your Majesty, please be clear!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.550 line:0%
Please clear Prince Xian's name!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.480 line:0%
Jin Zang!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.060 line:0%
-Mother!
-Jin Zang!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:21.870 line:0%
-Mother!
-Jin Zang!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.840 line:0%
You dare to spout nonsense even at death's door.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.640 line:0%
Guards!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.620 line:0%
Put him in the urn!

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.620 line:0%
Lai Luozhi!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:28.770 line:0%
How dare you torture him in public!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.780 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:06:33.209 --> 00:06:35.070 line:0%
I have something else to tell you.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.280 line:0%
This secret

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.280 line:0%
can only be told to you alone.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.020 line:0%
Step back!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.520 line:0%
You're a defenseless

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.570 line:0%
musician.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.040 line:0%
I'd like to hear

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.390 line:0%
what your

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.200 line:0%
dying words are.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.910 line:0%
My clansmen and I

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.300 line:0%
have suffered this calamity

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.640 line:0%
all because of you!

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.060 line:0%
-Uncle!
-Zang!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.140 line:0%
-Uncle!
-Zang!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:12.170 line:0%
Who dares!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.230 line:0%
-Zang.
-Back off!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.310 line:0%
Uncle!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:17.920 line:0%
Chest.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.980 line:0%
Fire moth.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.470 line:0%
Xing.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:28.440 line:0%
You must deliver this blood-written letter

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.100 line:0%
to the grand empress dowager.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.620 line:0%
Take good care of yourself.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.140 line:0%
You too.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.520 line:0%
Zang.

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.340 line:0%
Uncle.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.860 line:0%
Zang.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.300 line:0%
Zang.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.800 line:0%
No!

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.970 line:0%
Uncle!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:14.720 line:0%
Musician Jin!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.330 line:0%
Lai Luozhi!

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:31.580 line:0%
You even dare to snatch the evidence

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.130 line:0%
meant for the grand empress dowager

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.530 line:0%
in broad daylight?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.450 line:0%
Back off!

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.420 line:0%
What?

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.620 line:0%
Jin Zang is dead?

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:55.720 line:0%
When...

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.960 line:0%
When did I...

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.130 line:0%
order his death?

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.000 line:0%
Musician Jin, unable to bear the humiliation,

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.280 line:0%
cried out for Prince Xian's innocence

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.640 line:0%
during the public procession,

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.400 line:0%
saying it was all

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.880 line:0%
a plot by Lord Lai.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.730 line:0%
Then he took his own life on the street.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:14.920 line:0%
This is the blood-written letter

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.450 line:0%
Musician Jin left before dying,

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.300 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.790 line:0%
Your... Your Majesty!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.350 line:0%
[I feel guilty towards Prince Xian.]

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.350 line:0%
[I spent my life on music under Lai Luozhi's orders.]

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.320 line:0%
When did I...

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.370 line:0%
When did I

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.360 line:0%
order the Jin family's death?

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.360 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.120 line:0%
Jin Zang deluded the masses

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.730 line:0%
and spread malicious rumors!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.130 line:0%
Even before his death, he tried to frame me!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.360 line:0%
I am utterly wronged!

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.080 line:0%
Lord Lai, you inflated a trivial matter,

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.560 line:0%
turning an ordinary banquet

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:16.930 line:0%
into a bloodbath.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.040 line:0%
Now, with Musician Jin's death on the street,

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.440 line:0%
the court is in an uproar.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.920 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department is no longer fit

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.050 line:0%
to handle this case.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.000 line:0%
Your Majesty, please

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.280 line:0%
entrust the Jin family's custody

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.560 line:0%
to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.480 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.240 line:0%
You can't!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.320 line:0%
Enough!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.040 line:0%
You're still fighting for power even now.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.680 line:0%
You truly never give me peace.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.200 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.320 line:0%
Since you're not afraid of getting your hands dirty

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.750 line:0%
and insist on intervening,

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.480 line:0%
the Jin family

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.320 line:0%
shall be under your supervision.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.910 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:28.990 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.990 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:35.570 line:0%
You are indeed a clever person.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.110 line:0%
But aren't you worried

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.320 line:0%
that without my summons,

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.360 line:0%
I could punish you

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.950 line:0%
for barging into the palace in the middle of the night?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.590 line:0%
If you want to punish me,

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.310 line:0%
I can only accept the punishment.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:56.670 line:0%
You know what?

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.080 line:0%
Tonight,

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.960 line:0%
I read

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.960 line:0%
the music scores left by Jin Zang.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.050 line:0%
That was when I realized

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.320 line:0%
he had accompanied me for so long.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:35.400 line:0%
Huan, you should

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.720 line:0%
go easy on me.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.740 line:0%
How can I go easy in this game of Go?

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:41.760 line:0%
Even if you lose,

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.510 line:0%
I won't punish you.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.780 line:0%
No punishment for losing.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.630 line:0%
If I win,

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:52.380 line:0%
can I get a reward?

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.690 line:0%
What reward do you want?

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.280 line:0%
If I win this round,

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.520 line:0%
Huan,

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.530 line:0%
let me be the crown princess, okay?

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.240 line:0%
Okay.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:27.280 line:0%
It's a deal.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.170 line:0%
A wise man foresees the unseen.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.080 line:0%
Your Double Swallows move

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:55.200 line:0%
seems simple,

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.000 line:0%
yet brims with endless stratagems.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.210 line:0%
I...

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.480 line:0%
I've lost this round.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.960 line:0%
Then you must keep your promise, Huan.

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.400 line:0%
Okay.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.480 line:0%
I'll grant your wish.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.200 line:0%
From every dance I performed

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.080 line:0%
after entering the palace

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.160 line:0%
to every grand occasion of mine,

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.200 line:0%
on every sleepless night,

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.120 line:0%
his konghou

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.880 line:0%
was never absent.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.280 line:0%
This composition is still unfinished.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.160 line:0%
He intended to perform it

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.600 line:0%
at the ceremony after the Ming Hall

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.560 line:0%
was rebuilt.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.790 line:0%
He never spoke much.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:56.380 line:0%
Never.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.540 line:0%
He was so quiet

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.800 line:0%
that I often forgot

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.400 line:0%
there was such a person.

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:04.010 line:0%
As if

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.899 line:0%
behind the curtains,

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.720 line:0%
there was only a konghou.

00:17:10.369 --> 00:17:12.159 line:0%
When I was troubled,

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.780 line:0%
this konghou

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.440 line:0%
would play on its own

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:23.960 line:0%
soothing melodies.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.190 line:0%
This konghou

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:34.280 line:0%
will never sound again.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.160 line:0%
It's all my fault.

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:41.680 line:0%
But

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.760 line:0%
he's my only son.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.800 line:0%
You know what?

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.480 line:0%
When I was little, I had my fortune told.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.910 line:0%
The fortune-teller said

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.280 line:0%
my radiance was too great

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:13.210 line:0%
and would burn those around me.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:15.800 line:0%
He also said

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:21.620 line:0%
I would end up alone.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.580 line:0%
I was very angry at that time

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.120 line:0%
and even had someone

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:30.220 line:0%
beat that fortune-teller.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:39.780 line:0%
Now that I think about it,

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.940 line:0%
he was right.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:48.490 line:0%
Not a single person

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:55.200 line:0%
could accompany me to the end.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:10.580 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.800 line:0%
I know

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.440 line:0%
you've always wanted an answer too.

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.520 line:0%
Once this matter

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.320 line:0%
is completely settled,

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.560 line:0%
I will give you an answer.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.200 line:0%
You're still up?

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.160 line:0%
I'm thinking about my uncle.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.850 line:0%
I know you were close to your uncle.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.610 line:0%
It's natural to grieve.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.400 line:0%
I'll send you back to Yan's Mansion tomorrow.

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.000 line:0%
Spend some time with Ms. Jin.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:41.230 line:0%
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.290 line:0%
Grieving endlessly is futile.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:48.810 line:0%
I'm thinking about

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.720 line:0%
what my uncle said

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.720 line:0%
before he died.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:54.730 line:0%
Chest.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:56.320 line:0%
Fire moth.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.640 line:0%
Could it be that Musician Jin

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.340 line:0%
discovered something about Fire Moth Sect?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.330 line:0%
My uncle was defenseless.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.280 line:0%
He knew clearly he couldn't

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:11.680 line:0%
injure Lai Luozhi at all.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.520 line:0%
Yet before he died,

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.200 line:0%
he still used every last bit of his strength

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.520 line:0%
to lunge forward and tear at his collar.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.600 line:0%
Why?

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:19.440 line:0%
Was it just to humiliate him?

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.220 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:32.360 line:0%
Has Chuichui returned?

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:33.920 line:0%
Have you found Chuichui?

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.730 line:0%
Where did she go?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:39.040 line:0%
If anything happens to her,

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:39.760 line:0%
how can I face her

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.840 line:0%
deceased mother?

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.500 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.000 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:43.880 line:0%
I'll go look for her again.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:44.880 line:0%
I'll definitely bring her back.

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:45.480 line:0%
Okay.

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.020 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.610 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:18.970 line:0%
You really are not afraid of death.

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:22.010 line:0%
You're just a constable,

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:24.160 line:0%
yet you have the guts to trespass on Lai's Mansion.

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:25.840 line:0%
Where have you hidden Lu Chuichui?

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:27.970 line:0%
Do you know what you're talking about?

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:33.650 line:0%
Jiang Langxing, a constable,

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:36.920 line:0%
barged into Chief Censor's Mansion in the middle of the night.

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:40.250 line:0%
He spoke disrespectfully, and it's an unforgivable crime.

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:45.040 line:0%
Imprison him in the Imperial Investigation Department for punishment.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:56.310 line:0%
We constables

00:23:56.550 --> 00:23:59.080 line:0%
will never meet the same fate as Sun Tan again.

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:02.160 line:0%
You're not skilled enough.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:03.280 line:0%
Go back now!

00:24:17.660 --> 00:24:19.990 line:0%
Commander Xu, you injured my men

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:21.890 line:0%
without even hearing the fact.

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:23.910 line:0%
You owe me an explanation.

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:28.260 line:0%
Lai Luozhi,

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:29.640 line:0%
you know clearly

00:24:29.640 --> 00:24:30.880 line:0%
what you did.

00:24:30.970 --> 00:24:32.310 line:0%
If this escalates,

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:33.600 line:0%
who knows which of us

00:24:33.600 --> 00:24:34.840 line:0%
will suffer more?

00:24:35.600 --> 00:24:36.990 line:0%
And don't forget,

00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:38.680 line:0%
I can easily take things

00:24:38.680 --> 00:24:40.140 line:0%
from the imperial palace.

00:24:40.600 --> 00:24:41.600 line:0%
If you're hiding

00:24:41.600 --> 00:24:43.320 line:0%
something here,

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:46.720 line:0%
I have my ways to retrieve it.

00:24:53.640 --> 00:24:54.440 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:24:55.840 --> 00:24:56.640 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:24:58.680 --> 00:24:59.480 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:25:00.080 --> 00:25:00.680 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:01.800 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:25:28.900 --> 00:25:30.480 line:0%
She's just a young lady.

00:25:31.200 --> 00:25:32.740 line:0%
You actually care about her so much.

00:25:32.740 --> 00:25:33.960 line:0%
You know nothing!

00:25:35.960 --> 00:25:37.000 line:0%
In this world,

00:25:39.680 --> 00:25:41.480 line:0%
I'm all alone.

00:25:45.200 --> 00:25:46.880 line:0%
Only she can understand me.

00:25:49.840 --> 00:25:51.840 line:0%
Only she truly sympathizes with me.

00:26:10.240 --> 00:26:11.800 line:0%
I'm your family too.

00:26:14.280 --> 00:26:15.480 line:0%
I'm your sister.

00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:17.080 line:0%
I won't forgive anyone

00:26:17.160 --> 00:26:18.720 line:0%
who ruins my plans!

00:26:22.720 --> 00:26:24.080 line:0%
I will

00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:25.880 line:0%
get rid

00:26:26.720 --> 00:26:27.520 line:0%
of them

00:26:27.760 --> 00:26:28.880 line:0%
one by one!

00:27:08.520 --> 00:27:09.720 line:0%
I've been thinking

00:27:10.520 --> 00:27:12.200 line:0%
about what method I should use

00:27:12.600 --> 00:27:14.080 line:0%
to make you disappear forever

00:27:14.080 --> 00:27:15.480 line:0%
from this world,

00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:21.400 line:0%
without him discovering it's my doing.

00:27:25.880 --> 00:27:26.760 line:0%
But

00:27:27.760 --> 00:27:29.680 line:0%
in poison and the art of killing,

00:27:30.200 --> 00:27:31.760 line:0%
he's more skilled than I am.

00:27:35.920 --> 00:27:37.880 line:0%
But now, I've figured it out.

00:27:40.770 --> 00:27:42.370 line:0%
Instead of killing you,

00:27:43.080 --> 00:27:45.650 line:0%
it's more important to make sure

00:27:46.570 --> 00:27:47.990 line:0%
he can never have you.

00:28:06.120 --> 00:28:07.150 line:0%
Commander Xu?

00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:27.880 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:28:32.140 --> 00:28:33.550 line:0%
Chuichui! Chuichui!

00:28:33.580 --> 00:28:35.210 line:0%
Chuichui. Chuichui.

00:28:36.560 --> 00:28:37.360 line:0%
How are you?

00:28:37.560 --> 00:28:38.360 line:0%
Let me see.

00:28:38.480 --> 00:28:39.320 line:0%
Are you hurt?

00:28:41.600 --> 00:28:42.400 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:28:44.840 --> 00:28:45.640 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:46.960 line:0%
It's me.

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:53.200 line:0%
You fool!

00:28:53.560 --> 00:28:55.520 line:0%
What took you so long?

00:28:55.540 --> 00:28:57.200 line:0%
You're a big fool!

00:29:02.920 --> 00:29:04.870 line:0%
I... I went to Lai's Mansion to rescue you.

00:29:04.870 --> 00:29:06.380 line:0%
Commander Xu helped me.

00:29:06.660 --> 00:29:07.720 line:0%
That was when I knew

00:29:08.370 --> 00:29:10.390 line:0%
he already got you out.

00:29:17.980 --> 00:29:21.860 line:0%
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:29:30.230 --> 00:29:31.740 line:0%
I almost...

00:29:32.160 --> 00:29:34.940 line:0%
thought I'd never see you again.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:36.660 line:0%
I failed to protect you.

00:29:36.710 --> 00:29:37.960 line:0%
From now on,

00:29:38.050 --> 00:29:39.040 line:0%
I won't let anyone

00:29:39.040 --> 00:29:40.320 line:0%
hurt you again,

00:29:40.320 --> 00:29:41.000 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:29:41.860 --> 00:29:42.950 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:29:44.570 --> 00:29:45.520 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:29:51.010 --> 00:29:52.050 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:02.480 line:0%
What?

00:30:02.680 --> 00:30:03.810 line:0%
You were taken away?

00:30:04.160 --> 00:30:05.300 line:0%
When did that happen?

00:30:05.300 --> 00:30:07.160 line:0%
How come I didn't know that at all?

00:30:07.290 --> 00:30:09.290 line:0%
He didn't do anything to you, did he?

00:30:12.320 --> 00:30:13.160 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:30:14.080 --> 00:30:15.280 line:0%
I'm right here,

00:30:15.280 --> 00:30:17.010 line:0%
sitting in front of you, right?

00:30:24.680 --> 00:30:25.440 line:0%
Why did Lai Luozhi

00:30:25.440 --> 00:30:26.640 line:0%
suddenly kidnap you?

00:30:31.360 --> 00:30:32.160 line:0%
I'm afraid...

00:30:34.340 --> 00:30:36.440 line:0%
Chuichui was implicated because of me.

00:30:36.440 --> 00:30:37.240 line:0%
No,

00:30:38.320 --> 00:30:39.200 line:0%
that's not it.

00:30:42.880 --> 00:30:43.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:30:44.680 --> 00:30:45.520 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:30:46.130 --> 00:30:47.190 line:0%
Actually...

00:30:48.040 --> 00:30:49.520 line:0%
there's something

00:30:49.800 --> 00:30:51.470 line:0%
I've been keeping from you.

00:30:52.470 --> 00:30:53.500 line:0%
Actually,

00:30:53.610 --> 00:30:54.610 line:0%
the friend

00:30:55.440 --> 00:30:58.610 line:0%
from the Imperial Investigation Department I mentioned

00:30:58.610 --> 00:31:00.110 line:0%
is Lai Luozhi.

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:03.800 line:0%
Him?

00:31:06.030 --> 00:31:07.070 line:0%
In the beginning,

00:31:08.180 --> 00:31:10.580 line:0%
I always saw him in my mother's

00:31:10.760 --> 00:31:11.720 line:0%
graveyard.

00:31:12.520 --> 00:31:13.360 line:0%
I thought

00:31:13.760 --> 00:31:14.600 line:0%
he was a friend

00:31:14.600 --> 00:31:16.920 line:0%
with a ghost face mask who missed his deceased mother.

00:31:16.920 --> 00:31:17.950 line:0%
Later, he

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:20.040 line:0%
coincidentally saved me once.

00:31:20.660 --> 00:31:22.520 line:0%
So... So I...

00:31:23.360 --> 00:31:24.160 line:0%
So I...

00:31:25.280 --> 00:31:27.710 line:0%
Until your third sister was poisoned.

00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:28.680 line:0%
The prescription he gave me

00:31:28.680 --> 00:31:29.940 line:0%
was indeed effective.

00:31:30.070 --> 00:31:31.760 line:0%
And he told me

00:31:32.080 --> 00:31:33.320 line:0%
not to tell anyone.

00:31:33.720 --> 00:31:34.520 line:0%
So...

00:31:35.010 --> 00:31:37.040 line:0%
So I held onto a glimmer of hope.

00:31:37.480 --> 00:31:38.890 line:0%
I thought maybe

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:41.480 line:0%
he wanted to be a good person.

00:31:42.920 --> 00:31:44.800 line:0%
What am I supposed to say to you,

00:31:44.800 --> 00:31:45.720 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.200 line:0%
Have you really read

00:31:47.200 --> 00:31:48.920 line:0%
too many plays?

00:31:48.920 --> 00:31:50.720 line:0%
How could you believe him?

00:31:51.320 --> 00:31:52.120 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:31:52.540 --> 00:31:53.560 line:0%
if Jiang Langxing and I

00:31:53.560 --> 00:31:54.820 line:0%
had arrived any later,

00:31:54.880 --> 00:31:56.480 line:0%
I'm afraid you would have been forced

00:31:56.480 --> 00:31:58.080 line:0%
to marry the Black Rakshasa.

00:32:08.800 --> 00:32:09.600 line:0%
Right,

00:32:09.640 --> 00:32:10.440 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:12.240 line:0%
I remember your mother's grave

00:32:12.240 --> 00:32:12.840 line:0%
was lavishly built

00:32:12.840 --> 00:32:14.440 line:0%
by Uncle Lu.

00:32:14.600 --> 00:32:15.400 line:0%
Why would he

00:32:15.400 --> 00:32:16.520 line:0%
go there so often?

00:32:16.680 --> 00:32:18.240 line:0%
His mother's grave

00:32:18.460 --> 00:32:19.600 line:0%
happens to be

00:32:19.600 --> 00:32:21.080 line:0%
near my mother's grave.

00:32:21.080 --> 00:32:22.600 line:0%
I've been there once.

00:32:22.980 --> 00:32:24.960 line:0%
It looks like

00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:26.770 line:0%
an unremarkable lonely grave.

00:32:27.120 --> 00:32:28.840 line:0%
There's a name on it.

00:32:29.920 --> 00:32:30.980 line:0%
It's called Bi Luo.

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:33.040 line:0%
Bi Luo?

00:32:34.840 --> 00:32:36.290 line:0%
Lai Luozhi's mother

00:32:36.720 --> 00:32:37.400 line:0%
actually had

00:32:37.400 --> 00:32:38.920 line:0%
such a beautiful name.

00:32:39.000 --> 00:32:39.800 line:0%
I think he was just

00:32:39.800 --> 00:32:41.130 line:0%
pretending to be filial

00:32:41.200 --> 00:32:42.720 line:0%
in front of Chuichui.

00:32:43.800 --> 00:32:44.930 line:0%
Here's what I think.

00:32:45.840 --> 00:32:47.520 line:0%
Lai Luozhi went to such great lengths

00:32:47.520 --> 00:32:48.920 line:0%
to get close to Chuichui.

00:32:49.320 --> 00:32:50.240 line:0%
I'm afraid it was not just

00:32:50.240 --> 00:32:51.200 line:0%
for her.

00:32:51.840 --> 00:32:52.640 line:0%
Right,

00:32:53.240 --> 00:32:54.840 line:0%
in Lai Luozhi's secret room,

00:32:55.240 --> 00:32:56.680 line:0%
I think I saw something.

00:32:57.600 --> 00:33:00.020 line:0%
It was... a coronation robe

00:33:00.760 --> 00:33:01.880 line:0%
for the emperor.

00:33:04.780 --> 00:33:06.250 line:0%
Lai Luozhi probably thought

00:33:06.250 --> 00:33:07.040 line:0%
I didn't know

00:33:07.040 --> 00:33:08.040 line:0%
what it is,

00:33:08.200 --> 00:33:08.880 line:0%
so he directly

00:33:08.880 --> 00:33:10.320 line:0%
showed it to me.

00:33:10.580 --> 00:33:12.990 line:0%
At first, I pretended not to care,

00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:14.200 line:0%
but later,

00:33:15.010 --> 00:33:16.670 line:0%
when I took a closer look,

00:33:17.000 --> 00:33:18.800 line:0%
I found what's embroidered on it

00:33:19.080 --> 00:33:20.040 line:0%
isn't a dragon,

00:33:20.730 --> 00:33:22.230 line:0%
but a Taotie.

00:33:24.020 --> 00:33:25.690 line:0%
Among the dragon's nine sons,

00:33:26.970 --> 00:33:27.960 line:0%
the fifth son, Taotie,

00:33:27.960 --> 00:33:29.600 line:0%
is the most insatiable.

00:33:31.640 --> 00:33:32.440 line:0%
It seems

00:33:33.160 --> 00:33:34.490 line:0%
Lai Luozhi's ambition

00:33:35.950 --> 00:33:37.700 line:0%
is now laid bare.

00:33:41.480 --> 00:33:43.000 line:0%
I have some matters to attend to,

00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:43.920 line:0%
so I'm leaving.

00:33:46.440 --> 00:33:47.480 line:0%
I'll walk him out.

00:34:03.440 --> 00:34:04.280 line:0%
You can't go.

00:34:05.280 --> 00:34:07.140 line:0%
Have you forgotten about Sun Tan?

00:34:08.320 --> 00:34:09.360 line:0%
Sun Tan knew clearly

00:34:09.360 --> 00:34:10.700 line:0%
that Lai Luozhi had treasonous intentions,

00:34:10.700 --> 00:34:11.840 line:0%
but due to the lack of concrete evidence,

00:34:11.840 --> 00:34:12.880 line:0%
he died in vain.

00:34:14.430 --> 00:34:15.470 line:0%
Now we know

00:34:15.470 --> 00:34:16.950 line:0%
there's a coronation robe,

00:34:16.950 --> 00:34:17.760 line:0%
yet you want to stop me?

00:34:17.760 --> 00:34:18.800 line:0%
I know you're desperate

00:34:18.800 --> 00:34:20.430 line:0%
to avenge Sun Tan and clear his name,

00:34:20.430 --> 00:34:21.510 line:0%
but don't forget,

00:34:21.510 --> 00:34:23.200 line:0%
Chuichui was taken away by you last night.

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:23.990 line:0%
Lai Luozhi knows

00:34:23.990 --> 00:34:25.590 line:0%
she saw the coronation robe.

00:34:25.880 --> 00:34:27.479 line:0%
Of course he'll be prepared.

00:34:27.560 --> 00:34:29.160 line:0%
Are Lai's Mansion and the Imperial Investigation Department

00:34:29.160 --> 00:34:30.030 line:0%
harder to infiltrate

00:34:30.030 --> 00:34:31.490 line:0%
than the imperial palace?

00:34:32.320 --> 00:34:33.780 line:0%
When it comes to stealing,

00:34:33.880 --> 00:34:35.030 line:0%
as long as I set my mind to it,

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:36.760 line:0%
there's nothing I can't steal.

00:34:36.880 --> 00:34:38.280 line:0%
Even if I'll have to dig three feet

00:34:38.280 --> 00:34:40.600 line:0%
into the earth, I'll find what has been hidden

00:34:40.600 --> 00:34:41.560 line:0%
by Lai Luozhi.

00:34:41.680 --> 00:34:42.430 line:0%
The title of Thief Saint

00:34:42.430 --> 00:34:43.760 line:0%
is indeed well-earned.

00:34:44.510 --> 00:34:46.680 line:0%
But now, Lai's Mansion and the Imperial Investigation Department

00:34:46.680 --> 00:34:47.720 line:0%
are probably already layered

00:34:47.720 --> 00:34:48.280 line:0%
with traps,

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.430 line:0%
waiting for you to walk right into them.

00:34:49.430 --> 00:34:50.470 line:0%
It will be far more dangerous

00:34:50.470 --> 00:34:51.930 line:0%
than the imperial palace.

00:34:53.950 --> 00:34:54.760 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:34:56.120 --> 00:34:57.880 line:0%
why have you become so fussy?

00:34:58.160 --> 00:34:59.200 line:0%
Is this what happens

00:34:59.200 --> 00:35:00.400 line:0%
when a man gets a wife?

00:35:02.720 --> 00:35:03.680 line:0%
I'm afraid you'll soon

00:35:03.680 --> 00:35:05.040 line:0%
become like this.

00:35:12.880 --> 00:35:14.280 line:0%
Indeed, something's been off

00:35:14.280 --> 00:35:15.610 line:0%
in Xiang'an these days.

00:35:16.360 --> 00:35:17.480 line:0%
The 12 streets are full of people

00:35:17.480 --> 00:35:18.920 line:0%
from Nanlang and Xichen.

00:35:19.640 --> 00:35:20.840 line:0%
And they're securing street corners,

00:35:20.840 --> 00:35:23.040 line:0%
looking for houses, and renting shops.

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:25.600 line:0%
It feels like something big is about to happen.

00:35:25.600 --> 00:35:28.400 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has been keeping an eye on them.

00:35:28.400 --> 00:35:29.660 line:0%
I'm afraid you can only

00:35:29.800 --> 00:35:31.600 line:0%
keep an eye on a minority of them.

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:40.160 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:35:44.240 --> 00:35:45.700 line:0%
If anything happens to me,

00:35:47.880 --> 00:35:49.740 line:0%
please take care of Yun Que for me.

00:36:05.050 --> 00:36:06.200 line:0%
Same here.

00:36:22.800 --> 00:36:24.330 line:0%
Goodbye, Grand Commander.

00:36:35.170 --> 00:36:40.010 line:0%
[Memorial]

00:36:54.080 --> 00:36:55.150 line:0%
Jin Zang,

00:36:56.280 --> 00:36:57.920 line:0%
play something light.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:00.800 line:0%
Jin Zang.

00:37:05.700 --> 00:37:06.880 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:32.120 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:37:37.430 --> 00:37:38.320 line:0%
It's alright.

00:37:53.880 --> 00:37:55.650 line:0%
Today is the eighth day of the 12th lunar month.

00:37:55.650 --> 00:37:58.780 line:0%
The grand empress dowager should be rewarding the officials.

00:37:58.780 --> 00:38:00.640 line:0%
Why hasn't she appeared

00:38:00.760 --> 00:38:02.360 line:0%
at this hour?

00:38:02.520 --> 00:38:03.520 line:0%
Indeed.

00:38:03.610 --> 00:38:06.140 line:0%
Even Grand Commander hasn't shown up either.

00:38:08.770 --> 00:38:12.180 line:0%
The grand empress dowager suddenly felt unwell.

00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:14.520 line:0%
Today's matter of rewarding the officials

00:38:14.520 --> 00:38:16.140 line:0%
shall be handled by Lord Lai,

00:38:16.480 --> 00:38:18.120 line:0%
who will adjudicate based on

00:38:18.320 --> 00:38:20.040 line:0%
last year's precedents.

00:38:20.480 --> 00:38:22.490 line:0%
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:38:27.960 --> 00:38:31.060 line:0%
-Your Majesty, take care.
-Your Majesty, take care.

00:38:50.070 --> 00:38:53.070 line:0%
Then I'll act on behalf of the grand empress dowager

00:38:53.160 --> 00:38:54.090 line:0%
to

00:38:54.440 --> 00:38:57.400 line:0%
reward and punish the officials based on last year's performance.

00:38:57.400 --> 00:38:58.360 line:0%
How can Lai Luozhi be entrusted

00:38:58.360 --> 00:39:00.480 line:0%
with the power to reward and punish the officials?

00:39:00.480 --> 00:39:01.360 line:0%
Indeed.

00:39:01.400 --> 00:39:03.360 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department is merely a supervisory institution.

00:39:03.360 --> 00:39:04.960 line:0%
How can it overstep its authority like this?

00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:06.320 line:0%
This is utterly improper!

00:39:06.320 --> 00:39:08.320 line:0%
It's the grand empress dowager's edict.

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:09.480 line:0%
Do you want her to worry

00:39:09.480 --> 00:39:10.800 line:0%
while she's ill?

00:39:11.440 --> 00:39:12.240 line:0%
You,

00:39:12.600 --> 00:39:13.790 line:0%
or you,

00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:14.760 line:0%
or all of you,

00:39:15.490 --> 00:39:17.140 line:0%
you want to defy the edict?

00:39:28.260 --> 00:39:31.360 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:39:31.460 --> 00:39:35.740 line:0%
[Visiting Card]

00:39:31.770 --> 00:39:32.790 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:39:32.810 --> 00:39:34.480 line:0%
I am Director of the Ministry of Rites.

00:39:34.480 --> 00:39:36.740 line:0%
I am the secretary of the Ministry of War.

00:39:37.440 --> 00:39:38.240 line:0%
Reward.

00:39:38.090 --> 00:39:40.540 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:39:38.880 --> 00:39:39.680 line:0%
Reward!

00:39:40.100 --> 00:39:41.940 line:0%
Reward! Reward!

00:39:43.390 --> 00:39:45.260 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:39:43.840 --> 00:39:46.240 line:0%
-Thank you, Lord Lai.
-Thank you, Lord Lai.

00:39:48.290 --> 00:39:51.320 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:39:58.120 --> 00:39:58.920 line:0%
Aunt,

00:39:59.520 --> 00:40:00.780 line:0%
Mother is now gravely ill,

00:40:00.780 --> 00:40:02.640 line:0%
yet she allows no one to visit her.

00:40:02.730 --> 00:40:04.780 line:0%
Prince Xian is still being grounded.

00:40:04.780 --> 00:40:07.180 line:0%
Lai Luozhi now holds all power in his hands.

00:40:11.980 --> 00:40:13.160 line:0%
Aunt,

00:40:14.920 --> 00:40:16.480 line:0%
now half of the court officials have gone

00:40:16.480 --> 00:40:17.980 line:0%
to swear allegiance in Lai's Mansion.

00:40:17.980 --> 00:40:20.700 line:0%
The other half are just waiting at home for their doom.

00:40:20.700 --> 00:40:22.920 line:0%
The court is on the verge of chaos!

00:40:52.160 --> 00:40:53.760 line:0%
The court is not in chaos yet,

00:40:54.660 --> 00:40:56.260 line:0%
but your heart is.

00:40:57.210 --> 00:40:58.740 line:0%
When your heart is not calm,

00:40:58.930 --> 00:41:00.260 line:0%
your mind is unsettled.

00:41:00.400 --> 00:41:01.200 line:0%
Aunt,

00:41:01.700 --> 00:41:03.590 line:0%
how can I calm my heart?

00:41:06.120 --> 00:41:07.450 line:0%
No matter what happens,

00:41:07.480 --> 00:41:09.160 line:0%
you are still the princess.

00:41:09.740 --> 00:41:11.000 line:0%
Why are you panicking?

00:41:12.160 --> 00:41:12.960 line:0%
Aunt,

00:41:13.770 --> 00:41:15.400 line:0%
you know better than anyone how much weight

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:16.400 line:0%
this title of princess

00:41:16.400 --> 00:41:17.760 line:0%
truly carries.

00:41:18.360 --> 00:41:19.280 line:0%
His Majesty

00:41:19.280 --> 00:41:20.840 line:0%
still refuses to speak.

00:41:21.680 --> 00:41:22.840 line:0%
Although imperial physicians said

00:41:22.840 --> 00:41:24.300 line:0%
a sage speaks not in haste,

00:41:24.880 --> 00:41:25.600 line:0%
what if

00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:27.200 line:0%
he never speaks?

00:41:27.660 --> 00:41:29.560 line:0%
Now Mother is gravely ill.

00:41:29.930 --> 00:41:31.790 line:0%
If anything were to happen to her,

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:34.640 line:0%
Aunt,

00:41:35.730 --> 00:41:37.390 line:0%
the position of Regent

00:41:38.880 --> 00:41:39.800 line:0%
would become the key

00:41:39.800 --> 00:41:41.660 line:0%
to controlling the entire court.

00:41:49.520 --> 00:41:51.040 line:0%
You want me to help you?

00:41:52.320 --> 00:41:53.120 line:0%
Of course.

00:41:55.840 --> 00:41:57.640 line:0%
You just said it yourselfâ€”

00:41:58.040 --> 00:41:59.640 line:0%
the title of princess

00:41:59.800 --> 00:42:01.530 line:0%
doesn't carry too much weight.

00:42:02.170 --> 00:42:04.100 line:0%
I have cultivated detachment for years.

00:42:04.100 --> 00:42:06.360 line:0%
I've long seen through worldly affairs.

00:42:06.600 --> 00:42:08.040 line:0%
No matter what happens,

00:42:08.800 --> 00:42:10.200 line:0%
just remember one thing:

00:42:11.640 --> 00:42:12.920 line:0%
assist His Majesty.

00:42:14.400 --> 00:42:15.200 line:0%
Aunt.

00:42:17.640 --> 00:42:18.800 line:0%
No need to rush.

00:42:19.480 --> 00:42:20.280 line:0%
This

00:42:22.860 --> 00:42:24.590 line:0%
is just the beginning.